academy-id "q-69858" :question/problem "Calculate the minor of the entry ${d}_{33}$ in the matrix\n$D=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 54 \\\\ 11 & 6 & 7\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "The minor of ${d}_{33}=7$ (third row, third column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $7$ are removed: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 & ∗ \\\\ 4 & -1 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${d}_{33}=7$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-1)-(-2)\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-3-(-8) \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-69858/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69858"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319096/field-1/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" :answer/id #uuid "71e97608-6c1c-51e2-9aed-e21f3dfde233" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319096/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "a20ac927-78cb-5316-8ae7-111549d4c641" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319096/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "64c28f30-524c-5364-b11a-805f4dffe2c5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319096/field-1/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" :answer-field/choices ["q-319096/field-1/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" "q-319096/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319096" :question/id #uuid "ffdca226-d35a-593e-8cef-091714db0ce4" :question/math-academy-id "q-319096" :question/problem "For the matrix\n$B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 6\\end{aligned}],$\nfind the minor ${M}_{33}$ of the entry ${b}_{33}.$\n\n${M}_{33}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The minor of ${b}_{33}=6$ (third row, third column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $6$ are removed: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 & ∗ \\\\ 1 & -1 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${b}_{33}=6$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{33} & =\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-1)-5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-2-5 \\\\  & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-319096/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-319096"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127699/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "fb5f8118-57ac-5cd0-b1e3-90e225df0c5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127699/selection/12b48b00f9c1ff14570ca66bc629787a88856efba1cda24cfb28da58c148801a" :answer/id #uuid "372d7438-e6f3-5617-abdc-618e851981f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "22" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127699/selection/84ba06c5ef46c5ec9648beb7e3447fc668d456369383b0c063fb4b9a83b2adb9" :answer/id #uuid "b540fe3f-51a0-5475-9c53-5cb3f0d93706" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "33" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127699/selection/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" :answer/id #uuid "2213e1a4-c597-5325-8da3-8cd00b99758c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "45" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127699/select