5441b9e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319139/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer-field/choices ["q-319139/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319139" :question/id #uuid "a6434174-5c6c-5e73-8661-3e8b5b1e0618" :question/math-academy-id "q-319139" :question/problem "$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & r & 3 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & 9\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nGiven that the minor of ${b}_{23}$ is $15$, find the value of $r$ in the matrix above.\n\n$r=$\n {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate the minor of ${b}_{23},$ we remove the second row and third column: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & r & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${b}_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}1 & r \\\\ 7 & 8\\end{aligned}] & =1\\cdot 8-r\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =8-7r.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${b}_{23}$ is $15$, so we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8-7r & =15 \\\\ -7r & =7 \\\\ r & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $r=-1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-319139/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-319139"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-18247/selection/592b9f18cf04a8c75d513e20b1b4a536540e9c3c0f5c7614ffaf1943dc6c7d15" :answer/id #uuid "adb22bdb-3f6b-579f-a28c-38c8fb46ce8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18247/selection/2eb6bbd1b69183304d0bf5c012fe0c56f904879e296e43ca2f181d47be385e5f" :answer/id #uuid "8d553ff4-f15e-56da-9035-f594b21d0a5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18247/selection/4e6eeef5aa33ee4a1