ned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 4 \\\\ x & 3x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-7)\\cdot 3x-x\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-21x-4x \\\\  & =-25x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${a}_{32}$ is $-50$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-25x & =-50 \\\\ x & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-18247/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-18247"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-18239/selection/3156fa3aa006e591d496860456be38662b872375433bbcf5b2f4cb01e08eaa8b" :answer/id #uuid "c1ee9ea8-62d8-5cad-97a9-15d187f60311" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18239/selection/df4db84975e60d674b801d173cb5cfb2288fa116576130a9276453d4454d3267" :answer/id #uuid "8cdf44e5-a05f-5c21-b4d6-fec60261bb95" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18239/selection/88b0aa9daa69ecaf1d74aac63fcc4e057b21600c7299d0aa05e3209e32aeb835" :answer/id #uuid "231855f3-d286-5df5-942c-77edc8fa47da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18239/selection/264ed6922279f92bdc90c36a26ea47de8f6c6ab903ed9e63c8b8bb51a5a9d4f6" :answer/id #uuid "b85cb246-c698-55bc-8b18-da723deb5667" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18239/selection/af86b5ad5980c6f8a2a4e0fb1e31ea973a090ce54491a38b8db03542271a309e" :answer/id #uuid "63521ed3-045b-5774-b39a-ea27c3c032a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-18239/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "532a60cf-79bc-5817-8c3e-f2405d2ab092" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-18239/selection/264ed6922279f92bdc90c36a26ea47de8f6c6ab903ed9e63c8b8bb51a5a9d4f6" :answer-field/choices ["q-18239/selection/3156fa3aa006e591d496860456be38662b872375433bbcf5b2f4cb01e08eaa8b" "q-18239/selection/df4db84975e60d674b801d173cb5cfb2288fa116576130a9276453d4454d3267" "q-18239/selection/88b0aa9daa69ecaf1d74aac63fcc4e057b21600c7299d0aa05e3209e32aeb835" "q-18239/selection/264ed6922279f92bdc90c36a26ea47de8f6c6ab903ed9e63c8b8bb51a5a9d4f6" "q-18239/selection/af86b5ad5980c6f8a2a4e0fb1e31ea973a090ce54491a38b8db03542271a309e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-18239" :question/id #uuid "8109dc07-0894-5c72-a0c1-64a6ec00257c" :question/math-academy-id "q-18239" :question/problem "Given that the minor of ${c}_{23}$ is $-86$, find all the possible values of $x$ in the matrix\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 11 & x & 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the second row and third column:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 7 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 5 \\\\ 11 & x & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe minor of ${c}_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 7 \\\\ 11 & x\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 7 \\\\ 11 & x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot x-7\\cdot 11 \\\\  & =-3x-77.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${c}_{23}$ is $-86$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3x-77 & =-86 \\\\ -3x & =-9 \\\\ x & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-18239/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-18239"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128116/selection/76a2e03c814e436b84538271865797128a5871f8cebc539332d11bc29913973c" :answer/id #uuid "9bc16220-84f0-5d0e-8996-ff890ae74034" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$z=3$ and $z=6$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128116/selection/6df0f856770794d